{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6cc0c980306b1bc978257993cec21d0df07b43616dddc28d09c174d8c0355518",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_a:2_4_041_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be3e09fc78a31cc6562f40edf56d7fad766ab9a4a737cefbad4f3eb77b7e5ae9",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_a:2_4_041_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29b0af397e4cad2e4d4a373b1ec25aded646a21a697f334c6f1fbd40720cece8",
      "text": "前阵子的活动，好像在当地的报纸上也\n刊登了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_a:2_4_041_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a959479b399a27ce46824f0b60aa9238d08cb50d0d4706fb7465fd0ca76d1e3",
      "text": "我看了一下报道，夸奖了我的讲解引导，\n真的太高兴了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_a:2_4_041_02_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:045dfbbf483326f98ff0f7abdd39d0b8e97ea827fe947e7fefca54dcb063107c",
      "text": "列车员的风范真的很难拿捏，该怎么\n表现举止，我之前还有点犹豫不决……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_a:2_4_041_02_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:285e4549845ed00685d6f5c451dedfd68ddc549af9423a667d56d91a72ccb81e",
      "text": "但是大家都微笑着听我讲解，甚至还有孩子舍不得\n和我告别，反倒是我感动得不得了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_a:2_4_041_02_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77b8bfd10b2b9a60ed78e8098eafb5dfdf8c91e2838d6d79ece16d243f2af3e4",
      "text": "正因为深思熟虑过，现在我觉得自己\n完成了一次让大家开心的引导讲解。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_a:2_4_041_02_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90a6217a1f1e1cfd8a694b159afe51d4913031dc24fbab7812a2cdc1971d63af",
      "text": "通俗易懂，非常棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_a:2_4_041_02_09_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d2285de14332f9f81bdcc6c1fded39bea04a9be14f8428ebd617670704224ab",
      "text": "可靠又帅气！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_a:2_4_041_02_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec8c2999c214c0f7be4af2c51c1abcff1a41e31c7c79faee6dc35dc46af7502f",
      "text": "我用自己的方式查了资料，在表达方式上也下了功夫！\n因为想着当天肯定也会有小孩子参加。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_a:2_4_041_02_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b785f19eb7dbc0c63463d465d7c8b97ba41f1cb2e571cb3e1d6aee218f169240",
      "text": "哇，真的吗！我是带着一定要为大家做好向导的\n意识去努力尝试的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_a:2_4_041_02_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8436368284e90995f993e4bdb7b60c4b9100968e9b8d8c1c036f9d3fc8352462",
      "text": "能看到那么多参加活动的孩子们的笑容……\n努力真是太值得了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_a:2_4_041_02_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ea1c0f27f83658e8f126d1807ab94738008e4acae5487250fcde0f31bf031e9",
      "text": "制作人听我商量、给我提供了帮助，\n也非常感谢您！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_a:2_4_041_02_09_a:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a31ad98ee8924eaa54b88b3aec111313469c1ef2d046e85c56a0647cf3a8d71d",
      "text": "下一项工作我也会努力展现出帅气的一面的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
